<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH CUP FOURTH ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH CUP FOURTH ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Spanish Cup fourth</p>
<p>round, second leg matches on Thursday:</p>
<p> Extremadura	 1	Rayo Vallecano	2</p>
<p>(Rayo Vallecano won 4-3 on aggregate)</p>
<p>Playing later:</p>
<p> Real Madrid     v	  Barcelona  (first leg 2-3)</p>
<p>Played on Wednesday:</p>
<p> Athletic Bilbao   1	Racing Santander     1</p>
<p>(Racing Santander won 2-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Celta Vigo	  0	Llieda (II)	    0</p>
<p>(1-1 on aggregate. Celta Vigo won on away goals)</p>
<p> Espanyol	    0	Deportivo Coruna 0</p>
<p>(2-2 on aggregate. Espanyol won on away goals)</p>
<p> Real Betis	  3	Tenerife		 0</p>
<p>(Real Betis won 5-0 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Valencia	    0	Las Palmas	     2</p>
<p>(2-2 on aggregate. Las Palmas won 5-3 on penalties)</p>
<p>Played on Tuesday:</p>
<p> Compostela	  2	Atletico Madrid	3</p>
<p>(Atletico Madrid won 5-2 on aggregate)</p>
</text>
